  "interpretation": "<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.9535%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 49.9303%;\"><col style=\"width: 49.9303%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>RESULT IN UNITS&nbsp;</strong></td>\n<td><strong>REMARKS</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&le;20.0&nbsp;</td>\n<td>Negative</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20.1 - &lt;24.9</td>\n<td>Equivocal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&ge;25</td>\n<td>Positive</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Comments</strong><br>The test is meant for semi-quantitative detection of Mitochondrial M2 antibody. Mitochondrial M2 antibody is present in&nbsp;approximately 95% of patients with Primary Biliary Cirrhosis (PBC). Mitochondrial M2 antibody has an even higher specificity<br>for PBC.</p>",
